  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Rehabilitacin del Centro Histrico de Quito, Segunda Etapa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of Historical Downtown Quito, Second Stage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Consolidar el proceso de desarrollo econmico y social del Centro Histrico de Quito, as como de la ECH.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will finance activities and investments in the Historical Downtown Area of Quito of traffic, provision of basic infrastructure services, institutional development, and publicprivate partnership.</narrative>
  </description>
